@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam backgroundColor white
left to right direction
title CARD 2 - Use case: the three relationships

actor "Read-Only Viewer" as RO
actor "Analyst" as AN
AN --|> RO

rectangle "System boundary" {
  usecase "Sign in" as L
  usecase "Record the attempt" as REC
  usecase "Present second factor" as SF
  usecase "Verify integrity" as V
}

RO --> L
AN --> V

L  ..> REC : <<include>>
SF ..> L  : <<extend>>

note bottom of REC
  <<include>>  arrow goes BASE --> INCLUDED
  "Sign in ALWAYS records the attempt"
  Mandatory sub-behavior.
end note

note bottom of SF
  <<extend>>  arrow goes EXTENDING --> BASE
  "Presenting a second factor SOMETIMES extends sign in"
  Optional behavior. Arrow points AT the base.
end note

note right of RO
  GENERALIZATION: the TRIANGLE touches the PARENT.
  The PARENT generalizes. The CHILD specializes.
  Here: Read-Only Viewer is the MOST GENERAL actor.
  Analyst specializes it, Lead specializes Analyst,
  Administrator specializes Lead.
end note
@enduml
